<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pulte said upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pulte said upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney upgraded Pulte Corp to buy from outperform, a market source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock ended at 26-5/8 Tuesday.</p>
</text>
